WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.980
Infiltrator!

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:02.800
Good luck, McGibbets!

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.420
The fate of the world is in your hands!

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:28.780
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.840
I'm Mike. I'm Sean.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.180
And I'm Joe.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:41.280
Let it be known, as the manual states, that this is a top, top, top, top secret mission.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.640
Okay, this is not just a top secret mission.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:48.880
This is something that only Johnny Jimbo Baby McGibbets can handle.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:54.180
And if you haven't heard of him, that's because that's how good of a secret it is.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.540
Right. Nobody knows top spy Johnny Jimbo Baby.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.920
And also the last name McGibbets is kind of funny, too.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.300
So it's just all funny all around.

