00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:16.780
For, you know, it's up there in terms of worst titles I've ever heard.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:26.540
Yeah, this game, back to front, you can tell that it is just, like, one guy's very specific humor.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:31.260
