00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.740
I'm not saying that as, like, an insult.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:46.580
Like, you can still be cool and have incredibly lame humor, but the entire, like, instruction manual, like, all this plot framing stuff, it's, like, it's not dad jokes.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:53.920
But it's just, like, really, really cringy goofball stuff.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:56.140
